      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمُوزٌ</span></b>  A she-camel <i>of which one doubts whether
she be fat or not and therefore feels the hump:</i>
(A'Obeyd, S, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُمْزٌ</span> [or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُمُزٌ</span>, or both?].
(TA.) See 4, first sentence.

